            "review_title": "Review at Grandma Lu",
            "review_text": "Michael O\nSunshine Coast, Australia401 contributions\n0\nThe best banh mi\nApr 2025 • Couples\nWe were staying in district one and the hotel we stayed at recommended Grandma Lu’s for a meal. It was a great recommendation, we ended up having breakfast there four times and tried a beef hot pot for dinner as well. The meals were all great value served with top quality coffee. The staff were friendly, with the lady speaking very good English that helped us, not only with ordering but also other tourist information.\nRead more\nWritten April 15, 2025",
