            "review_title": "Review at Grandma Lu",
            "review_text": "Luthfil Hadi Ng\nSingapore, Singapore20 contributions\n0\nGrandma Lu for breakfast\nNov 2024 • Couples\nI ordered the famous Vietnamese egg coffee, Thai milk tea, beef stew and chicken banh mi. It was delicious. This is my second time coming to this simple and humble Vietnamese restaurant. The staff are polite and able to converse in English. All in all, I would recommend this place to those who are living in District 1. Give “Grandma Lu” a try for authentic Vietnamese cuisine. Thank you and see you soon Vietnam (HCM) !\nRead more\nWritten November 15, 2024",
