            "review_title": "Review at Grandma Lu",
            "review_text": "Víctor M\nLondon, United Kingdom57 contributions\n0\nSuper Tasty Banh Mì, Freshly baked on a brick oven. Also a well located and budget friendly home stay.\nApr 2023 • Solo\nThis Bakery & Hostel is located a few steps from Little Japan. It's quite well located nearby to the main attractions of the city.\n\nAmazing an super tasty freshly baked Banh Mì. Friendly staff, reasonable cost for laundry. The room is a bit small but quite enough for one person.\n\nShared bathroom (Japanese Style) on every floor and there is a balcony on the third floor.\n\nOn the ground floor, you can find a bakery with a wood oven, which makes the Banh Mì from this place always fresh and with a unique flavour.\nRead more\nWritten April 27, 2023",
